SUMMARY:2026 Fall Study Break: No Classes
DESCRIPTION:The 2026 Fall Study Break is from October 26 to October 30\, 2026. No classes will take place during the study break. \nIn Engineering courses\, no assessments may be scheduled nor assignments made due between Monday and the following Sunday of the study break week\, inclusive of those dates. \nThis does not prevent the Faculty from scheduling deferred exams during the break. Accommodations made by an instructor to an individual student as the result of a term-work petition or from accessibility services are also allowed during these days. \nFor the complete list of sessional dates\, visit the Engineering Academic Calendar.
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/2026-fall-study-break-no-classes/
CATEGORIES:U of T holidays & closures
END:VEVENT
