SUMMARY:Info Session: DAAD RISE Germany – Research Internships in Science & Engineering
DESCRIPTION:Learn more about DAAD (German Academic Exchange Service) and its research internship focusing on science and engineering. \nRISE Germany places undergrads (minimum two years of study completed) in paid summer research internships at German universities and institutes\, in fields like biology\, chemistry\, physics\, earth sciences\, engineering\, and computer science. Funding includes a monthly stipend\, travel support\, and insurance. German language is not required for most placements. \nRegistration & details
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/info-session-daad-rise-germany-research-internships-in-science-engineering/
LOCATION:Hybrid – Online or at Cumberland House (33 St. George St.)
CATEGORIES:Info sessions
END:VEVENT
